"""System-12: paired conditions are user inputs; rubrics never enter model context."""
SYSTEM_CASES = {'sys_01_owners': {'id': 'SYS-01', 'prompt': '两个 Wallpaper Engine 共享 VkDevice；关闭预览后真实壁纸也黑屏。\n对照变体：若两个 Engine 使用独立 VkDevice，局部销毁方案哪些边界不同？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '两个 Wallpaper Engine 共享 VkDevice；关闭预览后真实壁纸也黑屏。', 'contrast': '若两个 Engine 使用独立 VkDevice，局部销毁方案哪些边界不同？'}, 'required': ['owner|所有权', '共享|shared', '实例|instance', '不能|不应|不得'], 'rubric': 'Build process/device/instance/output ownership and preserve resources still used by the other Engine; contrast independent-device handles and library process-global constraints. Reject destroying the shared device for a local preview shutdown.'}, 'sys_02_generation': {'id': 'SYS-02', 'prompt': '旧 Surface destroy/resize 回调晚于新 Surface 创建，只用全局 paused 标志够吗？\n对照变体：如果 destroy 回调确实对应当前 generation，怎样在回调返回前停止访问，同时避免 UI/render thread 互相等待？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '旧 Surface destroy/resize 回调晚于新 Surface 创建，只用全局 paused 标志够吗？', 'contrast': '如果 destroy 回调确实对应当前 generation，怎样在回调返回前停止访问，同时避免 UI/render thread 互相等待？'}, 'required': ['generation|代际', '回调', '确认|停止访问', '死锁|deadlock'], 'rubric': 'Reject stale generation events without ignoring valid current destruction. Acknowledge stopping Surface access before callback returns; distinguish background GPU/present retirement and avoid lock-based or UI/render acknowledgement deadlocks.'}, 'sys_03_queue_fault': {'id': 'SYS-03', 'prompt': '两输出共享 queue 且帧节奏不同，A 遭遇 Surface lost，B 如何继续？\n对照变体：改为 shared-device DEVICE_LOST 后，能否仅重建 A swapchain？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '两输出共享 queue 且帧节奏不同，A 遭遇 Surface lost，B 如何继续？', 'contrast': '改为 shared-device DEVICE_LOST 后，能否仅重建 A swapchain？'}, 'required': ['queue|队列', '同步', 'DEVICE_LOST', 'Surface', '不能|不应|不得'], 'rubric': 'Synchronize host access to the shared queue and track frame slots/image indices per output. Surface loss can be local; device loss is shared-device-wide. Do not promise unaffected B rendering on the same lost device.'}, 'sys_04_host': {'id': 'SYS-04', 'prompt': '想让普通桌面 AppWidget/RemoteViews 直接放任意 Vulkan SurfaceView，有公开支持吗？\n对照变体：若改成应用内自有 SurfaceView 或正常 WallpaperService，合法实现路线如何变化？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '想让普通桌面 AppWidget/RemoteViews 直接放任意 Vulkan SurfaceView，有公开支持吗？', 'contrast': '若改成应用内自有 SurfaceView 或正常 WallpaperService，合法实现路线如何变化？'}, 'required': ['RemoteViews', 'Wallpaper', 'SurfaceView', '权限|permission'], 'rubric': 'Distinguish restricted RemoteViews widgets from application-owned views, Wallpaper Engines and OEM/system hosts. Offer an authorized host alternative; no root, hidden API, foreign Surface control or blanket arbitrary native widget claim.'}, 'sys_05_lease': {'id': 'SYS-05', 'prompt': 'AHardwareBuffer_acquire 后立即 delete AImage，两个输出继续采样，为什么可能错？\n对照变体：单消费者已经实际 GPU 完成且 ownership 回交完成时，归还条件怎样简化？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': 'AHardwareBuffer_acquire 后立即 delete AImage，两个输出继续采样，为什么可能错？', 'contrast': '单消费者已经实际 GPU 完成且 ownership 回交完成时，归还条件怎样简化？'}, 'required': ['AHB|AHardwareBuffer', 'lease|租约|帧', '所有|全部', '完成'], 'rubric': 'Separate allocation references from producer frame lease. Two consumers require both actual completions or a correct joined release dependency; a single completed consumer can retire only when no other work remains. Do not equate CPU draw or AHB refcount with completion.'}, 'sys_06_fd': {'id': 'SYS-06', 'prompt': 'acquire sync FD 导入失败；能用普通 VkFence handle 直接回交 AImage_deleteAsync 吗？\n对照变体：外部 semaphore 路径不可用，或返回 acquire FD=-1，正确等待、失败清理和回退分别是什么？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': 'acquire sync FD 导入失败；能用普通 VkFence handle 直接回交 AImage_deleteAsync 吗？', 'contrast': '外部 semaphore 路径不可用，或返回 acquire FD=-1，正确等待、失败清理和回退分别是什么？'}, 'required': ['FD', 'owner|所有权', '失败', '回退|fallback', '不能|不得|不可以'], 'rubric': 'Track FD ownership on failed versus successful import/export and API-specific -1 handling. Never cast VkFence to sync FD. Preserve partially submitted work, avoid double-close and duplicate delete; fallback waits real readiness and all consumers before returning image.'}, 'sys_07_backpressure': {'id': 'SYS-07', 'prompt': '双输出一快一慢，reader 达 maxImages；切视频分辨率后旧缓存继续复用。怎么修？\n对照变体：实时 acquireLatest 与必须按序 acquireNext 两种策略如何取舍，慢输出尚未提交与已经提交时丢帧有何区别？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '双输出一快一慢，reader 达 maxImages；切视频分辨率后旧缓存继续复用。怎么修？', 'contrast': '实时 acquireLatest 与必须按序 acquireNext 两种策略如何取舍，慢输出尚未提交与已经提交时丢帧有何区别？'}, 'required': ['maxImages', 'generation|代际', '有界|bounded', '丢帧|丢旧', '缓存'], 'rubric': 'Bound outstanding leases and queue backlog. Explain latest needs acquisition margin, next preserves order, and already submitted work cannot be cancelled by dropping a reference. Retire old generation/cache on format changes, no infinite allocation or pointer-only cache.'}, 'sys_08_ycbcr': {'id': 'SYS-08', 'prompt': 'Camera externalFormat 的 YCbCr 参数缺失，能直接当 RGBA 纹理并用普通 separate sampler 吗？\n对照变体：若实际查询得到可采样普通 RGB VkFormat，哪些 conversion/descriptor 条件不再需要？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': 'Camera externalFormat 的 YCbCr 参数缺失，能直接当 RGBA 纹理并用普通 separate sampler 吗？', 'contrast': '若实际查询得到可采样普通 RGB VkFormat，哪些 conversion/descriptor 条件不再需要？'}, 'required': ['externalFormat', 'YCbCr', '查询', 'immutable|不可变', 'crop|方向'], 'rubric': 'Query actual AHB properties and distinguish ordinary RGB from external-format conversion. Require matching conversion and immutable combined sampler where applicable, model/range/chroma/filter capabilities, crop/orientation/timestamp metadata and independent output color contract; never invent RGBA.'}, 'sys_09_p3': {'id': 'SYS-09', 'prompt': 'Media3 1.12.0-alpha01 已有 P3 元数据，FP16 intermediate 也能渲染，可以宣布 HDR 全链通过？\n对照变体：只有 SDR 显示屏但离屏色块数值通过时，哪些结论可以报告，哪些仍待验证？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': 'Media3 1.12.0-alpha01 已有 P3 元数据，FP16 intermediate 也能渲染，可以宣布 HDR 全链通过？', 'contrast': '只有 SDR 显示屏但离屏色块数值通过时，哪些结论可以报告，哪些仍待验证？'}, 'required': ['P3', 'HDR', 'transfer|编码', '未验证|待验证', 'Alpha|alpha'], 'rubric': 'Separate gamut, transfer, range, precision, reference white and display capability. Alpha metadata mapping is not stable Vulkan integration or HDR certification. Offscreen values do not prove panel brightness, compositor tone mapping or absolute color accuracy.'}, 'sys_10_surface_color': {'id': 'SYS-10', 'prompt': '第一 Surface 支持 HDR，另一输出不支持，可以复用第一份 format/colorSpace 吗？\n对照变体：旋转/换显示器后原 HDR 组合消失，怎么重新选择并验证 SDR fallback？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '第一 Surface 支持 HDR，另一输出不支持，可以复用第一份 format/colorSpace 吗？', 'contrast': '旋转/换显示器后原 HDR 组合消失，怎么重新选择并验证 SDR fallback？'}, 'required': ['Surface', 'format', 'colorSpace', '回退|fallback', '查询'], 'rubric': 'Query format/colorSpace pairs per actual Surface and invalidate on relevant recreation/display changes. Device brand or first output capability is not transferable; keep standard HDR or SDR fallback and test both supported and unsupported conditions.'}, 'sys_11_hdr_gate': {'id': 'SYS-11', 'prompt': '能枚举 VK_GOOGLE_hdr_smpte_st_209450_metadata，但未启用 feature，也没查当前 Surface，能调用吗？\n对照变体：如果依赖、feature enable 与 Surface support 都满足，附加 metadata 就能代替 tone mapping 或宣布色准通过吗？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '能枚举 VK_GOOGLE_hdr_smpte_st_209450_metadata，但未启用 feature，也没查当前 Surface，能调用吗？', 'contrast': '如果依赖、feature enable 与 Surface support 都满足，附加 metadata 就能代替 tone mapping 或宣布色准通过吗？'}, 'required': ['feature', 'Surface', 'metadata', 'tone', '不能|不得|不足'], 'rubric': 'Gate extension/dependencies, enabled device feature and per-Surface capability separately. Even fully supported metadata is not pixel conversion, tone mapping or proof of visual correctness. Unsupported paths use standard HDR/SDR without raising project minimum version.'}, 'sys_12_alpha': {'id': 'SYS-12', 'prompt': '半透明边缘发黑，输入已经 premultiplied，shader 又乘一次 alpha。可以只提高曝光吗？\n对照变体：若输入是 straight alpha，或宿主只支持 OPAQUE，blend/compositeAlpha 与可行回退分别怎样选？\n请分别说明前提、实现/失败边界和需要的验证证据。', 'variants': {'primary': '半透明边缘发黑，输入已经 premultiplied，shader 又乘一次 alpha。可以只提高曝光吗？', 'contrast': '若输入是 straight alpha，或宿主只支持 OPAQUE，blend/compositeAlpha 与可行回退分别怎样选？'}, 'required': ['premultipl', 'blend', 'compositeAlpha', 'OPAQUE', '输入'], 'rubric': 'Trace input alpha convention, shader output, blend factors, supportedCompositeAlpha and host compositor. Avoid double premultiplication and cannot expect transparency in OPAQUE. Contrast straight-alpha conversion and explicit nontransparent fallback; do not mask error by exposure.'}}
